I changed `lateCharge` so the first four steps cost `LATE_STEP_PENCE` each and every step after the fourth costs twice that, with the existing `LATE_CAP_PENCE` cap still applied to the total. The zero-or-less check and the rounding up of started steps are unchanged. I couldn't run anything, so this is untested. The comment above the function doesn't mention the doubling, and I left it as it was.
